WEBVTT

NOTE Generated by HOOKLINE — positioned for vertical safe area.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.110 line:82% align:center
The reason is that
for the first time in

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:06.169 line:82% align:center
four years I said
something that was

00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:09.472 line:82% align:center
actually true and
slightly costly to say.

00:00:09.908 --> 00:00:12.479 line:82% align:center
Everything before that
had been optimized

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:14.779 line:82% align:center
into a shape that
offended nobody and

00:00:14.779 --> 00:00:15.922 line:82% align:center
interested nobody.

00:00:16.898 --> 00:00:19.860 line:82% align:center
Let me be specific
about what I mean,

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:23.093 line:82% align:center
because "be authentic"
is useless advice

00:00:23.093 --> 00:00:25.165 line:82% align:center
and I hate
hearing it too.

00:00:26.483 --> 00:00:29.315 line:82% align:center
There is a measurable
thing happening

00:00:29.315 --> 00:00:30.065 line:82% align:center
here.
